      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/jul/26/andy-burnham-to-meet-volodymyr-zelenskyy-uk-ukraine",
      "description": "<p>Ukrainian president will be first overseas visitor for new British prime minister</p><p>Volodymyr Zelenskyy will become Andy Burnham’s first overseas visitor as prime minister, in a visit that Burnham said underlined Britain’s “unwavering” backing for Ukraine.</p><p>Less than two weeks after Keir Starmer travelled to Kyiv for the final foreign visit of his prime ministership, the Ukrainian president will on Monday join Burnham at a naval base where Ukrainian forces have been receiving training.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/jul/26/andy-burnham-to-meet-volodymyr-zelenskyy-uk-ukraine\">Continue reading...</a>",
